{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>泰國布吉府周一（16日）發生嚴重火災，初步統計已造成11人死亡、逾30人受傷。</p>\n<p>事發在當地時間凌晨3時17分，地點是布吉府卡圖縣芭東地區，一棟4層高的商業樓宇，起火後波及8間店舖。路透社報道，傷者中15人是泰國公民，一人是緬甸公民， 警方表示死傷者中沒有遊客。（路透社/新華社）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T06:54:13.432522+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T03:36:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T11:11:51.483915+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T06:47:51.157514+00:00","content_hash":"4523f8fd0b6969afeb4f80c088666263deb4b9628c30db05bf64485ed557a8e3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}